                    content: 'Portfolios showcase selected work at its finest moment, curated by the agency that built it. True technical competence requires looking past static screenshots and testing live implementations against modern standards like [web design trends that matter for business growth](/blog/web-design-trends-for-business-growth) and speed benchmarks:',
